  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"container container--wide mt-5\" role=\"main\">\n   <div class=\"post homepage\">\n    <section class=\"homepage-lead\" aria-label=\"最新论文解读\">\n     <article class=\"homepage-featured\">\n      <a class=\"homepage-featured__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/when-unlearning-fails-reliable-data-deletion-under-post-training-in-agent-networ/\"> \n       <div class=\"homepage-featured__media\">\n        <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/when-unlearning-fails-reliable-data-deletion-under-post-training-in-agent-networ-c199b1b4ba-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/when-unlearning-fails-reliable-data-deletion-under-post-training-in-agent-networ-c199b1b4ba-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/when-unlearning-fails-reliable-data-deletion-under-post-training-in-agent-networ-c199b1b4ba-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 66vw, 760px\" alt=\"MUTE：消除智能体网络中的遗忘回声，上行通信成本最高缩减80%\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\">\n       </div> \n       <div class=\"homepage-featured__body\">\n        <p class=\"homepage-card__label\">最新发布</p>\n        <h2>MUTE：消除智能体网络中的遗忘回声，上行通信成本最高缩减80%</h2>\n        <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 11 分钟阅读</p>\n        <p class=\"homepage-featured__description\">针对这一挑战，研究人员提出了名为 MUTE （Muting Unlearned Trajectories' Echoes）的系统性解决方案，通过轻量级账本溯源、模型与数据联合遏制，以及长期行为审计机制，在物理边缘测试床上实现了低通信开销下的可靠数据擦除。</p>\n        <div class=\"homepage-card__topics\">\n         <span>AI Agent</span><span>模型训练</span>\n        </div>\n       </div> \n      </a>\n     </article>\n     <div class=\"homepage-lead__side\">\n      <article class=\"homepage-card homepage-card--lead\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/visko-orbis-10-a-live-model-for-real-time-interactive-long-video-generation/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/visko-orbis-10-a-live-model-for-real-time-interactive-long-video-generation-4fc95c4a16-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/visko-orbis-10-a-live-model-for-real-time-interactive-long-video-generation-4fc95c4a16-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/visko-orbis-10-a-live-model-for-real-time-interactive-long-video-generation-4fc95c4a16-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"Visko Orbis 1.0：边播边改指令！有界记忆打通4K 24帧实时交互长视频\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__label\">多模态&amp;视觉</p>\n         <h2>Visko Orbis 1.0：边播边改指令！有界记忆打通4K 24帧实时交互长视频</h2>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__description\">Visko Orbis 1.0 没有盲目堆叠全量历史上下文，而是提出了一套有界多尺度记忆（Bounded Multi-Scale Memory）架构： 近端与远端的分...</p>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 10 分钟阅读</p>\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"homepage-card homepage-card--lead\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/vidmap-exploiting-temporal-structure-for-video-based-structure-from-motion/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/vidmap-exploiting-temporal-structure-for-video-based-structure-from-motion-dfaae1c5c8-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/vidmap-exploiting-temporal-structure-for-video-based-structure-from-motion-dfaae1c5c8-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/vidmap-exploiting-temporal-structure-for-video-based-structure-from-motion-dfaae1c5c8-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"VidMap：时序约束碰撞全局SfM，苏黎世联邦理工等攻克长视频度量重建\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__label\">多模态&amp;视觉</p>\n         <h2>VidMap：时序约束碰撞全局SfM，苏黎世联邦理工等攻克长视频度量重建</h2>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__description\">来自苏黎世联邦理工学院（ETH Zurich）、Google 与微软（Microsoft）的研究团队提出了 VidMap。该框架并没有在原有路径上做缝缝补补，而是系统...</p>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 14 分钟阅读</p>\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </article>\n     </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"homepage-feed\" aria-labelledby=\"homepage-feed-title\">\n     <div class=\"homepage-section-heading homepage-section-heading--feed\">\n      <div>\n       <p class=\"homepage-card__label\">PAPER INSIGHTS</p>\n       <h2 id=\"homepage-feed-title\">最新解读</h2>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"homepage-card-grid\">\n      <article class=\"homepage-card\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/tracevit-grounded-trace-supervision-for-visual-abstract-reasoning/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/tracevit-grounded-trace-supervision-for-visual-abstract-reasoning-b4a07b8632-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/tracevit-grounded-trace-supervision-for-visual-abstract-reasoning-b4a07b8632-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/tracevit-grounded-trace-supervision-for-visual-abstract-reasoning-b4a07b8632-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"TraceViT：循环推理不能只看终点，带接地的轨迹监督突破67.8%\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 13 分钟阅读</p>\n         <h3>TraceViT：循环推理不能只看终点，带接地的轨迹监督突破67.8%</h3>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__description\">发表于近期的一项研究提出了 TraceViT 。它的核心主张看似直观：既然人类在纸上推理时是逐步绘制草图，循环视觉模型的中间迭代也应当沿着一条语义连贯的“轨迹”逐步推进。然而，该研究揭示了一个反直觉的现象： 如果在循环...</p>\n         <div class=\"homepage-card__topics\">\n          <span>推理</span><span>多模态&amp;视觉</span>\n         </div>\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"homepage-card\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/stealthbench-measuring-operational-stealth-in-autonomous-offensive-security-agen/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/stealthbench-measuring-operational-stealth-in-autonomous-offensive-security-agen-b0e81b23b7-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/stealthbench-measuring-operational-stealth-in-autonomous-offensive-security-agen-b0e81b23b7-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/stealthbench-measuring-operational-stealth-in-autonomous-offensive-security-agen-b0e81b23b7-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"StealthBench：攻破靶标却暴露行踪？8款主流大模型最高潜行成功率仅54%\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 14 分钟阅读</p>\n         <h3>StealthBench：攻破靶标却暴露行踪？8款主流大模型最高潜行成功率仅54%</h3>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__description\">StealthBench：基于这套裁判体系，研究团队提出了三项核心指标，重新定义了攻防智能体的能力图谱： - 安全成功率（Safe Success Rate） ：基准的核心主指标，指在所有有效运行中，智能体既成功拿到 ...</p>\n         <div class=\"homepage-card__topics\">\n          <span>AI Agent</span><span>AI安全</span>\n         </div>\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"homepage-card\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/siren-towards-end-to-end-extreme-weather-early-warning-with-experience-grounded-/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/siren-towards-end-to-end-extreme-weather-early-warning-with-experience-grounded-c5a85cb9cf-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/siren-towards-end-to-end-extreme-weather-early-warning-with-experience-grounded-c5a85cb9cf-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/siren-towards-end-to-end-extreme-weather-early-warning-with-experience-grounded-c5a85cb9cf-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"SIREN：港科大等提出端到端气象预警Agent，实战性能提升近30%\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 12 分钟阅读</p>\n         <h3>SIREN：港科大等提出端到端气象预警Agent，实战性能提升近30%</h3>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__description\">针对 SIREN-Bench 暴露出的业务短板，研究团队提出了 SIREN 框架。该框架的底层逻辑在于：拒绝纯文本口嗨，拒绝缺乏事实依据的盲目推理。整个框架由两大部分构成：高度可交互的执行环境（Agentic Envi...</p>\n         <div class=\"homepage-card__topics\">\n          <span>AI Agent</span>\n         </div>\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"homepage-card\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/shijianbench-from-dialogue-to-decision-for-long-horizon-evaluation-of-investment/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/shijianbench-from-dialogue-to-decision-for-long-horizon-evaluation-of-investment-f6f2908eda-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/shijianbench-from-dialogue-to-decision-for-long-horizon-evaluation-of-investment-f6f2908eda-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/shijianbench-from-dialogue-to-decision-for-long-horizon-evaluation-of-investment-f6f2908eda-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"ShiJianBench：评测AI投顾不能只看回复，7199人校准的长程决策新基准\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 11 分钟阅读</p>\n         <h3>ShiJianBench：评测AI投顾不能只看回复，7199人校准的长程决策新基准</h3>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__description\">为了复现真实人类面对金钱诱惑与亏损恐惧时的复杂心理，ShiJianBench 没有采用常见的单一静态 Prompt 角色设定（Persona），而是提出了一个结构化的多智能体投资者模拟器（Multi-agent Inv...</p>\n         <div class=\"homepage-card__topics\">\n          <span>AI评测</span>\n         </div>\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"homepage-card\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/self-supervised-skill-optimization/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/self-supervised-skill-optimization-27e2d35649-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/self-supervised-skill-optimization-27e2d35649-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/self-supervised-skill-optimization-27e2d35649-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"SSO：无标注也能自我进化？行为级证据聚合逼平有监督优化\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 12 分钟阅读</p>\n         <h3>SSO：无标注也能自我进化？行为级证据聚合逼平有监督优化</h3>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__description\">这项最新工作直接击中了这一痛点，提出了首个无须真实标签的自我监督技能优化框架： SSO（Self-Supervised Skill Optimization） 。</p>\n         <div class=\"homepage-card__topics\">\n          <span>模型优化</span>\n         </div>\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"homepage-card\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/self-play-meets-skill-evolution-self-evolving-search-agents-that-pose-solve-and-/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/self-play-meets-skill-evolution-self-evolving-search-agents-that-pose-solve-and-edb3c5562b-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/self-play-meets-skill-evolution-self-evolving-search-agents-that-pose-solve-and-edb3c5562b-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/self-play-meets-skill-evolution-self-evolving-search-agents-that-pose-solve-and-edb3c5562b-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"SESA：搜索Agent在自博弈中演化技能，脱离外挂记忆依然提升2.2分\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 12 分钟阅读</p>\n         <h3>SESA：搜索Agent在自博弈中演化技能，脱离外挂记忆依然提升2.2分</h3>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__description\">针对这一割裂现状，最新研究提出了 SESA （Self-Evolving Skill-Augmented Agent，自演化技能增强智能体）。该方法首次将在线程序化技能演化无缝嵌入工具增强搜索的自博弈训练中。</p>\n         <div class=\"homepage-card__topics\">\n          <span>AI Agent</span><span>推理</span>\n         </div>\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"homepage-card\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/refactorassist-agentic-refinement-for-reliable-code-refactoring/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/refactorassist-agentic-refinement-for-reliable-code-refactoring-05cee115b9-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/refactorassist-agentic-refinement-for-reliable-code-refactoring-05cee115b9-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/refactorassist-agentic-refin