bea270d8-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/dexmani-human-derived-manipulability-guidance-for-dexterous-rotation-e5bea270d8-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"DexMani：把人类经验转化为可操作度演化，四种机械手旋转成功率达57.5%\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 13 分钟阅读</p>\n         <h3>DexMani：把人类经验转化为可操作度演化，四种机械手旋转成功率达57.5%</h3>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__description\">针对这一根本矛盾，这项研究提出了 DexMani 。它的核心洞察在于：向机械手传授人类多指操作经验时， 机器人真正需要学习的不是人类手指在关节空间的几何轨迹，而是物体旋转过程中“可操作度如何随接触状态演化”的通用规律 。</p>\n         <div class=\"homepage-card__topics\">\n          <span>基础模型</span>\n         </div>\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"homepage-card\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/denseon-with-the-lateon-fully-open-dense-and-late-interaction-models-for-multili/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/denseon-with-the-lateon-fully-open-dense-and-late-interaction-models-for-multili-3cd3ae4b3b-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/denseon-with-the-lateon-fully-open-dense-and-late-interaction-models-for-multili-3cd3ae4b3b-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/denseon-with-the-lateon-fully-open-dense-and-late-interaction-models-for-multili-3cd3ae4b3b-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"从DenseOn到mLateOn：LightOn用28亿数据证明，延迟交互才是多语言检索更优解？\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 12 分钟阅读</p>\n         <h3>从DenseOn到mLateOn：LightOn用28亿数据证明，延迟交互才是多语言检索更优解？</h3>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__description\">基于预训练掩码语言模型 mmBERT-base（307M 参数），团队分别构建了单向量模型 mDenseOn 与多向量模型 mLateOn。两者训练时的骨干网络完全相同，训练批次完全相同，数据配比完全相同，且均引入了针...</p>\n         <div class=\"homepage-card__topics\">\n          <span>推理</span><span>AI理论</span>\n         </div>\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"homepage-card\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/data-pyramid-for-embodied-manipulation/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/data-pyramid-for-embodied-manipulation-d633a05186-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/data-pyramid-for-embodied-manipulation-d633a05186-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/data-pyramid-for-embodied-manipulation-d633a05186-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"具身操作最新综述！五层数据金字塔与大模型训练配方全景解析\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 13 分钟阅读</p>\n         <h3>具身操作最新综述！五层数据金字塔与大模型训练配方全景解析</h3>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__description\">这篇综述所提出的 五层数据金字塔 ，不仅是对现有数据集碎片化现状的分类总结，更为下一代具身大模型指明了研发全景：未来的系统不可能依赖单一数据源取得成功，而是必然走向以通用图文铸造通用认知、以合成仿真扩张探索广度、以手持...</p>\n         <div class=\"homepage-card__topics\">\n          <span>具身智能</span><span>模型训练</span>\n         </div>\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"homepage-card\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/cross-embodiment-transfer-via-behavior-aligned-representations/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/cross-embodiment-transfer-via-behavior-aligned-representations-ef58f321c7-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/cross-embodiment-transfer-via-behavior-aligned-representations-ef58f321c7-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/cross-embodiment-transfer-via-behavior-aligned-representations-ef58f321c7-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"破解异构机械臂迁移难题！行为对齐表征让真机任务进度提升28%\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 11 分钟阅读</p>\n         <h3>破解异构机械臂迁移难题！行为对齐表征让真机任务进度提升28%</h3>\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__description\">面对这一瓶颈，最新研究提出了利用 行为对齐表征 （Behavior-Aligned Representations）来打破本体壁垒的新思路。这项研究的核心观察在于：尽管机器人的外观和关节参数各异，但在完成同一类操作任务时。</p>\n         <div class=\"homepage-card__topics\">\n          <span>AI安全</span>\n         </div>\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"homepage-card\">\n       <a class=\"homepage-card__link\" href=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/tutorials/crafts-collaborative-role-adaptive-fine-tuning-of-llm-agents-for-chemical-proces/\"> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__media\">\n         <img src=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/crafts-collaborative-role-adaptive-fine-tuning-of-llm-agents-for-chemical-proces-c4f6e23767-640.webp\" srcset=\"https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/crafts-collaborative-role-adaptive-fine-tuning-of-llm-agents-for-chemical-proces-c4f6e23767-320.webp 320w, https://agifrontier.github.io/assets/img/homepage-thumbnails/crafts-collaborative-role-adaptive-fine-tuning-of-llm-agents-for-chemical-proces-c4f6e23767-640.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 320px, (max-width: 1100px) 45vw, 360px\" alt=\"CRAFTS：不做端到端代码生成，七角色协同让化工模拟成功率达91.5%\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div> \n        <div class=\"homepage-card__body\">\n         <p class=\"homepage-card__meta\">2026年10月06日 · 12 分钟阅读